{title: 097 - Lord of the Boundless Curves of Space}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #097 • SAN ROCO • 9.7.7.7}
{lyricist: Albert F. Bayly}
{composer: Derek Williams}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 97}
{meta: tune SAN ROCO}
{meta: meter 9.7.7.7}
{meta: category God the Father - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Lord [Bdim]of [Em]the [Dm]boundless [G]curves [C]of [Em]space
[Em]And time's [G]deep [C]mystery,
[Am]To [F]Your [C]creative [Em]might [Am]we [G]trace
[G/D]All nature's [Am]energy.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Your [Bdim]mind [Em]conceived [C]the [G]galaxy,
[Em]Each [Am]atom's [C]secret [Em]planned,
[Am]And every [Bdim]age [Em]of [Am]history
[G/D]Your purpose, [Am]Lord, [Bdim]has [G]spanned.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Yours [Bdim]is [Em]the [Dm]image [G]stamped on [C]man,
[Em]Though [Am]marred [G]by [C]man's [F]own [Em]sin;
[Am]And [F]Yours [C]the [Bdim]liberating [G/D]plan
[G/D]Again [C]his [Am]soul [Bdim]to [G]win.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]Give [Bdim]us [Em]to [Dm]know [C]Your [G]truth; but [C]more,
[Em]The [Am]strength [G]to [C]do [F]Your [Em]will;
[Am]Until [C]the [Bdim]love [Em]our [Am]souls [G]adore
[G/D]Shall [C]all [Am]our [Bdim]being [G]fill.
{end_of_verse}
